ng other peoples' language and claiming it as your own. This also includes automatic and machine translation, as well as AI language generation. Any instances of plagiarism will result in a score of zero for the task, and possibly for the entire course.\nIn, late submissions will not be accepted principle. \n------------------------\nPlease refer to the following URL for details regarding the attendance and tardiness policy.\nhttps://kwic.kwansei.ac.jp/cabinet/area/detail?areaId=7144&directLink=1\n------------------------"}